{"logId": "7ab25857-04bd-4608-b448-704979935be1", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [839, 135, 1084, 254], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1084.0, 135.0], [1084.0, 254.0], [839.0, 254.0]]}, {"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "情浓电影厅", "block_bbox": [200, 227, 467, 283], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 227.0], [467.0, 227.0], [467.0, 283.0], [200.0, 283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：新乡百货电影厅", "block_bbox": [260, 293, 425, 315], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[259.99993896484375, 292.9999694824219], [423.99993896484375, 292.9999694824219], [423.99993896484375, 313.9999694824219], [259.99993896484375, 313.9999694824219]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "岁月匆匆，时光飞逝，转眼间胖东来百货已走过了三个春夏秋冬。在这三年的风雨历程中，电影厅在公司领导和兄弟部门的支持下，在影厅全体兄弟姐妹的打拼下，在我们的观众认可与帮助监督下，已由一颗细嫩的小苗长成了大树，并创造了在全省奥斯卡院线中地市票房第一名的佳绩。", "block_bbox": [199, 373, 976, 503], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 373.0], [976.0, 373.0], [976.0, 503.0], [199.0, 503.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "08年的平安夜，胖东来百货到处人头攒动，电影厅的休闲走廊也挤满了等候入场的观众，看着售票处顾客一票难求的表情。我再一次为胖东来特有的经营理念折服。“你心我心，将心比心”我们对顾客好，他们能感受到。想着平日为观众自备了急救药物箱，为视力不好的观众准备的各种眼镜。逢年过节，为顾客摆放的糖果小点盘，夏季里的\n冰冻西瓜等等。我们做了，而且不是自作多情，是观众所需。观众需要的还有很多很多，我们都会认真去想，认真去做。此时看看我们不停的忙碌，看看顾客开心的笑脸，感觉周围一切很美，心情很好，商业真的可以为人带来文明和快乐。\n仕电影厅，通过电影，通过服务，对多会员与观众都成为了我们的朋友。时间久了，他们生活中的感人故事，我们也略晓一二。", "block_bbox": [198, 511, 977, 641], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 511.0], [977.0, 511.0], [977.0, 641.0], [198.0, 641.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [198, 650, 515, 955], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 650.0], [515.0, 650.0], [515.0, 955.0], [198.0, 955.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [198, 964, 641, 1061], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 973.0], [198.0, 1060.0], [640.0, 1060.0], [635.0, 973.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [530, 635, 1077, 1067], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[530.0, 635.0], [1077.0, 635.0], [1077.0, 1067.0], [530.0, 1067.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "有一个会员，他是军队领导，在汶川地震中，他连续一", "block_bbox": [238, 1070, 719, 1095], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1070.0], [719.0, 1070.0], [719.0, 1095.0], [238.0, 1095.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "个月都抗战在灾区一线，先前他们总是一家三口来看电影，得知情况之后，我们电影厅再见到他，总会以最真诚的敬意邀请他一家免费观影，但他婉拒了我们。他们一家一如既往地购票观影，并很自觉地遵守我们的观影制度。在他们家身上，我和我们兄弟姐妹更懂得了责任与约束。", "block_bbox": [198, 1104, 976, 1235], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 1104.0], [976.0, 1104.0], [976.0, 1235.0], [198.0, 1235.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.7589924335479736, "coordinate": [839, 135, 1084, 254], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1084.0, 135.0], [1084.0, 254.0], [839.0, 254.0]]}, {"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.739315390586853, "coordinate": [200, 227, 467, 283], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[200.0, 227.0], [467.0, 227.0], [467.0, 283.0], [200.0, 283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.754834771156311, "coordinate": [260, 293, 425, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[259.99993896484375, 292.9999694824219], [423.99993896484375, 292.9999694824219], [423.99993896484375, 313.9999694824219], [259.99993896484375, 313.9999694824219]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9428893327713013, "coordinate": [199, 373, 976, 503], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 373.0], [976.0, 373.0], [976.0, 503.0], [199.0, 503.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9430297613143921, "coordinate": [198, 511, 977, 641], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 511.0], [977.0, 511.0], [977.0, 641.0], [198.0, 641.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9404417872428894, "coordinate": [198, 650, 515, 955], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 650.0], [515.0, 650.0], [515.0, 955.0], [198.0, 955.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9192517399787903, "coordinate": [530, 635, 1077, 1067], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[530.0, 635.0], [1077.0, 635.0], [1077.0, 1067.0], [530.0, 1067.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9183939099311829, "coordinate": [198, 964, 641, 1061], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 973.0], [198.0, 1060.0], [640.0, 1060.0], [635.0, 973.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8160789608955383, "coordinate": [238, 1070, 719, 1095], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 1070.0], [719.0, 1070.0], [719.0, 1095.0], [238.0, 1095.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9437032341957092, "coordinate": [198, 1104, 976, 1235], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 1104.0], [976.0, 1104.0], [976.0, 1235.0], [198.0, 1235.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 情浓电影厅\n\n作者：新乡百货电影厅\n\n岁月匆匆，时光飞逝，转眼间胖东来百货已走过了三个春夏秋冬。在这三年的风雨历程中，电影厅在公司领导和兄弟部门的支持下，在影厅全体兄弟姐妹的打拼下，在我们的观众认可与帮助监督下，已由一颗细嫩的小苗长成了大树，并创造了在全省奥斯卡院线中地市票房第一名的佳绩。\n\n08年的平安夜，胖东来百货到处人头攒动，电影厅的休闲走廊也挤满了等候入场的观众，看着售票处顾客一票难求的表情。我再一次为胖东来特有的经营理念折服。“你心我心，将心比心”我们对顾客好，他们能感受到。想着平日为观众自备了急救药物箱，为视力不好的观众准备的各种眼镜。逢年过节，为顾客摆放的糖果小点盘，夏季里的\n\n冰冻西瓜等等。我们做了，而且不是自作多情，是观众所需。观众需要的还有很多很多，我们都会认真去想，认真去做。此时看看我们不停的忙碌，看看顾客开心的笑脸，感觉周围一切很美，心情很好，商业真的可以为人带来文明和快乐。\n\n仕电影厅，通过电影，通过服务，对多会员与观众都成为了我们的朋友。时间久了，他们生活中的感人故事，我们也略晓一二。\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_530_635_1077_1067.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"45%\" /></div>\n\n\n有一个会员，他是军队领导，在汶川地震中，他连续一\n\n个月都抗战在灾区一线，先前他们总是一家三口来看电影，得知情况之后，我们电影厅再见到他，总会以最真诚的敬意邀请他一家免费观影，但他婉拒了我们。他们一家一如既往地购票观影，并很自觉地遵守我们的观影制度。在他们家身上，我和我们兄弟姐妹更懂得了责任与约束。", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1084_254.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ab25857-04bd-4608-b448-704979935be1/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1084_254.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A55%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2F9239a7580d77e93b5bbdd0498afb1244f6b16fa3570a7c2283fc28acc845bb1e", "imgs/img_in_image_box_530_635_1077_1067.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ab25857-04bd-4608-b448-704979935be1/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_530_635_1077_1067.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A55%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2F3039bf8f7da61bcbdd529f6da1349105bbc24314cf19580dded22d0f1917deeb"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ab25857-04bd-4608-b448-704979935be1/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A55%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2F735f0f76cb96c702f7f524be12dda3c3acb956b9068524101023b5349984a96c"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ab25857-04bd-4608-b448-704979935be1/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A55%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2F29fd87fe13fb1a0ecf1302e2576f07535b9583e341cd2ed018fdd86a2331eb7c"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-o